    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "无直流 $F_{0}=a_{0}=0$ 奇对称 $\\Rightarrow a_{n}=0$ $\\Rightarrow F_{n}=-\\frac{1}{2}b_{n}$ 经应形式",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            277,
            774,
            360
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {F _ {n}} & {= \\frac {1}{T _ {1}} \\int_ {T _ {1}} ^ {1} f (t) e ^ {- j n w _ {1} t} d t} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {- 1} ^ {1} t e ^ {- j n w _ {1} t} d t = j \\frac {(- 1) ^ {n}}{n \\pi}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            246,
            365,
            650,
            467
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore x (t) = \\sum_ {n = - v _ {0}} ^ {\\infty} f _ {n} e ^ {j n w _ {1} t} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 0, & n = 0 \\\\ \\sum_ {n = - v _ {0}} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {j (- 1) ^ {n}}{n \\pi} e ^ {j n \\pi t}, & n \\neq 0 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
